%% APX AutoMai — Context Diagram (Level 0 DFD)
flowchart TB
    GUEST[Guest Visitor]
    CUST[Registered Customer]
    ADMIN[Administrator]
    CRON[External Cron Service<br/>cron-job.org]

    SYS(("APX AutoMai<br/>Unified Portal"))

    MAIL[Email Service<br/>Brevo SMTP]
    SMS[SMS Gateway<br/>Semaphore]

    GUEST -->|booking request, vehicle details| SYS
    SYS -->|booking reference, confirmation email| GUEST

    CUST -->|registration, vehicle, booking, points redemption| SYS
    SYS -->|booking history, points balance, reminders,<br/>service-due alerts| CUST

    ADMIN -->|status updates, cancellations with reason, services, bundles, settings| SYS
    SYS -->|dashboard, schedule, customer records, reports| ADMIN

    CRON -->|token-guarded tick, every 5 minutes| SYS
    SYS -->|what ran, and for how long| CRON

    SYS -->|reminder and confirmation messages| MAIL
    SYS -->|reminder text messages| SMS
    MAIL -->|delivery result| SYS
    SMS -->|message id, delivery status| SYS
